[38;5;231m⏺[39m I added a checkbox to [38;5;153mindex.html[39m. The page had nothing in it, so I added one placeholder item, "My task".

  - [1mMarkup:[0m a native [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m inside a [38;5;153m<label>[39m, so clicking the text also toggles it.
